- [x] Confirm Unity editor version for project creation: `2022.3.47f1`.
- [x] Confirm URP `14.0.11` as the rendering pipeline.
- [x] Confirm first-slice team count: Ice versus Fire.
- [x] Confirm first pressure system: shrinking safe boundary.
- [x] Confirm territory authority experiment and decision gate.
- [x] Confirm target PC minimum for performance validation.
- [x] Confirm keyboard/mouse and gamepad as required devices.
- [x] Confirm elimination versus non-lethal disruption.
- [x] Confirm bank behavior for the slice.
- [x] Confirm initial match duration target.
- [x] Confirm working title remains EntropyTag.

